[00:15.504]Don’t try to make yourself remember, darling
{"亲爱的 别强迫自己回忆"}
[00:21.774]Don’t look for me, I’m just a story you’ve been told
{"别寻找我 我只是你听过的传说"}
[00:26.905]So let’s pretend a little longer
{"让我们再假装久一点"}
[00:32.736]Cause when we’re gone
{"因为当我们消失后"}
[00:35.030]Everything goes on
{"万物仍会继续"}
[00:38.666]
[00:40.101]Well, you were staring at the window
{"那时你凝望着窗扉"}
[00:45.239]And I said, “I wanna take you to the sea
{"我说：「想带你去海边」"}
[00:52.393]And when I’m better, we’ll do everything”
{"等我好些 我们就实现所有心愿"}
[00:56.983]I gotta stop making promises I can’t keep
{"我该停止许下无法兑现的诺言"}
[01:02.818]
[01:03.400]But if I was gone tomorrow
{"但若我明天就离去"}
[01:06.492]Won’t the waves crash on?
{"浪涛难道会停歇？"}
[01:09.562]Is it selfish that I’m happy
{"我这样幸福是否自私"}
[01:12.479]As we pass the setting sun?
{"当我们共赏落日时？"}
[01:15.552]Someday I’ll be overcast
{"终有一天我将如阴云消散"}
[01:18.427]But you won’t have to cry -
{"但你不必哭泣——"}
[01:22.674]Cause we’ll do the grieving
{"因为我们会共同面对悲伤"}
[01:25.682]While I’m by your side
{"趁我还陪伴在你身旁"}
[01:27.717]I said:
{"我说："}
[01:28.884]
[01:28.951]Don’t try to make yourself remember, darling
{"亲爱的 别强迫自己回忆"}
[01:35.132]Don’t look for me, I’m just a story you’ve been told
{"别寻找我 我只是你听过的传说"}
[01:40.279]So let’s pretend a little longer
{"让我们再假装久一点"}
[01:46.043]Cause when we’re gone
{"因为当我们消失后"}
[01:48.303]Everything goes on
{"万物仍会继续"}
[01:52.247]
[02:05.769]And I’m so scared of getting used to this
{"我如此恐惧习惯这一切"}
[02:10.851]All the vines that keep you tethered in your room
{"那些将你禁锢在房间的藤蔓"}
[02:18.119]Well, someday both of us are leaving here
{"终有一天 我们都将离开这里"}
[02:22.958]But for now, I’ll just bring the sea to you, oh
{"但此刻 我只想为你带来整片海 哦"}
[02:28.735]
[02:28.970]Will you meet me in the daylight
{"你会在白昼时分与我相遇吗"}
[02:32.019]Like we did before?
{"像我们从前那样？"}
[02:35.053]Then I felt you on my shoulder
{"那时我感受到你倚靠在我肩头"}
[02:37.948]And you weren’t suffering anymore
{"你已不再痛苦"}
[02:41.148]Said, “I’m sorry that you worried”
[02:44.087]But don't apologize
{"但不必道歉"}
[02:47.629]I told you to forget me
{"我曾要你忘了我"}
[02:50.871]But you stayed by my side
{"你却始终守候"}
[02:53.247]When I said:
{"当我说道："}
[02:54.505]
[02:54.512]“Don’t try to make yourself remember, darling
[03:00.704]Don’t look for me, I’m just a story you’ve been told”
[03:05.946]So let’s pretend a little longer
{"就让我们再假装片刻"}
[03:11.591]And when we’re gone, oh
{"待我们消逝后 哦"}
[03:16.996]Everything goes on
{"万物仍会继续"}
